<title>USA: TABLE - Balchem Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Balchem Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SLATE HILL, N.Y. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>($000 Omitted Except for Net Earnings Per Share)</p>
<p>				  For the Three Months Ended June 30,</p>
<p>						    1997	  1996</p>
<p> Sales					    7,308	6,664</p>
<p> Net Income					 862	  473</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share			    0.27	 0.15</p>
<p>				    For the Six Months Ended June 30,</p>
<p>						     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Sales					   14,143     12,921</p>
<p> Net Income				     1,579	  907</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share			    0.50	 0.29</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said higher sales and earnings for current Q2 is due to increased sales of encapsulated ingredients for the food industry.</p>
</text>
